# Build context for both app images is the repository root (npm workspaces need the
# root lockfile and every workspace manifest). Everything below is irrelevant in an image.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets never enter an image; .env.example is documentation and stays.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
docs
Makefile
docker-compose.yml
**/*.md
!README.md
